      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is something \"like\" what I needed which was to know when the player is first fully in the world. The point can be seen in the logs, all initial sync'ing has completed. I called my method OnWorldLoaded as it occurs right after that message in the logs. I think I would prefer an event over having to poll for it though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
